---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Zhima — Geping Chen"
  description="Meet Zhima, Geping Chen’s cat, and learn how she got her Chinese name."
>
  <header class="page-hero zhima-hero">
    <div class="shell reading-column">
      <p class="eyebrow">Zhima · <span lang="zh">芝麻</span></p>
      <h1>Meet Zhima.</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">Our eleven-month-old cat and a much-loved member of our family.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="zhima-story-title">
    <div class="shell reading-column zhima-story">
      <h2 id="zhima-story-title">How she got her name</h2>
      <p>
        We adopted Zhima in August 2026. At the time, her English name was Sushi. We tried many
        Chinese names, and <span lang="zh">“芝麻”</span> (Zhima) was the first one she responded to.
        That is how she got her Chinese name. <span lang="zh">芝麻</span> means “sesame” in English.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-contrast" aria-labelledby="zhima-photos-title">
    <div class="shell reading-column zhima-photos">
      <h2 id="zhima-photos-title">Photos</h2>
      <p>A few photos of Zhima will be added here soon.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .zhima-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .zhima-story p,
  .zhima-photos p {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .zhima-story p {
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
  }

  .zhima-photos p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
